    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "We can find the sum of natural numbers using a simple formula:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "Sum of natural numbers=n∗(n+1)2Sum\\ of\\ natural\\ numbers  = \\frac{n*(n+1)}{2}Sum of natural numbers=2n∗(n+1)​"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Let's use this formula to find the sum of natural numbers."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "content": "1def calculate_sum(n):\n2    return n * (n + 1) // 2\n3    \n4result = calculate_sum(100)\n5print(result)    # 5050"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "This program runs in a fraction of a second, even for very large numbers. It's because we solved this problem with a single instruction, regardless of the size of the input."
    },
